        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Samsung Adopts the Same Silicon Photonics Development Partners as TSMC  Samsung Electronics has been found to have selected the same development partners as Taiwan's TSMC for silicon photonics, a technology that uses light to reduce semiconductor bottlenecks, heat, and power",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096908177271033916",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-07T18:27:22.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 279
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "瑞銀降評大立光（3008）  一、 瑞銀並非否定大立光做 CPO 的能力，而是認為：認證才剛開始、競爭很擠、手機近況不亮，但股價已用很高倍數把「成功打進 CPO」提前反映，因此改為賣出、目標價 5,000 元。  後續觀察點：樣品線與良率、整合商／ODM／GPU 客戶設計導入、9 月與 Q3 營收能否追上、以及 CPO",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2096840919593152667",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:00:07.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 145
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "早安！9/8 外電綜合整理  - 2455全新：美系升目標 美系券商最新house view 上修2026–28E 全球光收發模組出貨量。分別上調 21%／31%／31%，將 800G+ 出貨量預估分別上調 31%／39%／36%，並將 1.6T+ 出貨量預估分別上調 29%／61%／50%。  全新8月營收大幅優於美系預期，反映 AI",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2097118838412484879",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:24:28.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 62
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "MPI Corp., the Taiwan maker of probe cards for semiconductor testing, won Samsung Electronics as a new client for cards used with silicon photonics (Photonic IC wafers), media report, noting MPI’s top customer is TSMC. Samsung will also use probe cards from FormFactor, the US",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2097124648282685779",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:47:33.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 35
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "TSMC’s OIP Forum 2026 kicks off in Silicon Valley on Sep. 23, followed by Hsinchu Nov. 12 focused on advanced manufacturing processes and advanced packaging (3D IC multi-die architectures, CoWoS, SoIC and Co-Packaged Optics (Silicon Photonics), media report, noting keynotes",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2097124382351217078",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:30.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 14
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "三星加速矽光子布局，採與台積電相同、已通過 CPO 認證的 FormFactor、MPI（旺矽）探針台，自行測試 PIC 晶圓，量測波長／頻率域光電特性，驗證光傳輸與電光轉換。目標今年底完成內部評估，取代先前委外 imec。",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2097184579920756867",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-08T12:45:42.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 8
        },
        {
          "handle": "subhash-km-6b5443123",
          "platform": "LinkedIn",
          "text": "GPT-6 Astra trained on 100k GB NVLink 72. 🔥",
          "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7502705529417310208/",
