          "text": "VIGO'S PHOTONICS FOUNDRY HAS A NEW NAME. THE PLAN IS THE SAME. \"Sparc Foundry\", the photonic chip fab under construction in Vigo, is now Ardora III-V. Same team, same site, same mission. What changed is the label, and the label tells you something about where the company thinks it is going.   Start ",
